<title>USA: Genovese Drug ups qtly div to $0.07/shr.</title>
<headline>Genovese Drug ups qtly div to $0.07/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genovese Drug Stores Inc said on Monday that it increased its quarterly cash dividend to $0.07 a share from $0.06 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend would be payable on July 8, 1997 to shareholders of record as of July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>On June 5, 1997, Genovese Drug Stores reported record sales and net income for its first quarter ended May 23, 1997.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
